## API reference

### OTPField

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `length:` | `Integer` | - | **Required.** Number of slots. |
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `String` | - | Spread across the slots. |
| `variant:` / `size:` | `:outline`/`:soft` / `:sm`/`:md`/`:lg` | `:outline` / `:md` | Every slot. |
| `validation_type:` | `:numeric`, `:alpha`, `:alphanumeric`, `:none` | `:numeric` | Accepted characters. |
| `mask:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Hide the characters. |
| `auto_submit:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Submit the form when complete. |
| `name:`, `required:`, `disabled:`, `read_only:`, `invalid:` | | | Form behaviour. |

Events: `ui--otp-field:change` and `ui--otp-field:complete`, with `{ value }`.

### OTPFieldInput, OTPFieldSeparator

A slot (native `<input>`, give it an `aria_label:`), and a divider between groups - a dash unless given content.

## Accessibility

- Name the group (`aria_label:`) and each slot ("Digit 1 of 6").
- The first slot carries `autocomplete="one-time-code"` for OS autofill.
